            "detailed_description": "Doomed'n Damned is an action game based on retro/classic platform games from Arcades and 16 bit consoles, but revised to the HD era. The level design, characters, plot and difficulty have a lot of influence from the late 80s and early 90s games. The development and production is by arc-gen, an one man indie game studio.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\nFeatures: <br />\r\n- 16 Bit cheesy sense of humor <br />\r\n- Epic boss fighting <br />\r\n- Voice over dialogues <br />\r\n- Challenging difficulty <br />\r\n- Classic level design <br />\r\n- Classic weapons and skills <br />\r\n- Multiple path levels <br />\r\n- Secret items and areas <br />\r\n<br />\r\nFor more information: <br />\r\n<br />\r\nTwitter: https://twitter.com/arcgengames <br />\r\nFacebook: https://www.facebook.com/arcgengames <br />\r\nDoomed'n Damned website: http://www.doomedndamned.com/",
